This PR takes the approach proposed by @yihui and adds some bells and whistles that automagically handles the serialization and deserialization of variables created using the `htmlwidgets::JS` function. The code is fairly self explanatory. I have tested it with `rCharts2` and it works beautifully, helping me deprecate the `jsonfn` dependency. I will be running a few more tests and will update the PR appropriately.

